	"data": "Keio University — KMD / SFC / Science & Technology\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research. See also [[projects/mext-scholarship-2029|Mext Scholarship 2029]] for funding details.\n\nOverview\n\nKeio University stands out for its creative, design-oriented approach to XR — particularly through KMD's Embodied Media Project (Prof. Minamizawa) and SFC's Cyber Informatics/X-Design programs. The Embodied Media Project is world-class for haptics/VR/telexistence with regular…",
